      "content": "interesting. so u mentioned the Islamic Golden Age helping out the europeans, but what about other regions? like i was reading something about how african empires or even pre-colonial american societies had really advanced ways of handling law or math too. do u think those were just as central to the \"foundations\" of the modern world, or were they just more localized compared to the stuff that shaped the west?",
